// Track D differential probe: chain targeting, smart selection, RNG container helpers.
//
// Trinity's text (tc_chain_*.inc, generated by extract.py) compiled against the
// minimal stubs below.  Reads line-oriented cases from stdin, prints one JSON
// object per case.  Floats cross the boundary as C99 hex literals (%a / strtof).
//
// Stubs (cut points) -- see extract.py docstring:
//   Spell::SearchAreaTargets  -> driver candidate list (order preserved), records radius/source
//   Spell::IsWithinLOS        -> driver table (default clear)
//   WorldObject::HasInArc     -> per-object driver flag
//   Spell::GetMinMaxRange     -> driver value
//   Player::GetSpellModValues -> driver flat/pct
//   Unit::IsInRaidWith, Unit::HasAura, Creature::IsTreatedAsRaidUnit -> driver facts
//   urand / irand / rand32    -> scripted sequences with recording

